<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-National Computer said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-National Computer said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney cut its rating of National Computer Systems Inc to neutral from outperform, according to a source at the brokerage firm.</p>
<p>-- Shares slipped 1/2 to 25-1/4 in early trading on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Barry Bosak could not be reached for immediate comment.</p>
</text>
